  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "California Current Ecosystems",
  "description": "Several studies and surveys were conducted during spring and fall of 2002. The studies and surveys include the California sea lions and northern fur seals on the San Miguel Island, southern resident Killer Whale foraging behavior, Harbor porpoise aerial survey, inland Washington waters small cetacean boat survey, and Washington Harbor Porpoise movements. AFSC Quarterly Report: Jul. - Sep. 2002\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Population assessment of the California Current ecosystems.",
